<title>USA: Wall Street stocks start higher.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks start higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened higher, after the core U.S. August Producer Price Index came in lower than expected on Thursday. A strong bond market also boosted stocks.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials index rose 11 to 5,766. The long bond rose 13/32 to yield 7.08 percent.</p>
